{'symbol': 'CE', 'date': '2022-08-24 09:00:00', 'title': 'CELANESE ANNOUNCES GRANT AWARD TO DEVELOP LONG-ACTING, REFILLABLE DRUG DELIVERY SOLUTION', 'text': 'DALLAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $CE--CELANESE CORPORATION (NYSE: CE), A GLOBAL CHEMICAL AND SPECIALTY MATERIALS COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED RECEIPT OF A GRANT FROM THE BILL & MELINDA GATES FOUNDATION TO PRODUCE AND CHARACTERIZE A WORKING PROTOTYPE FOR A REFILLABLE CONTRACEPTIVE IMPLANT. THE RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT WILL BE CONDUCTED WITHIN THE CELANESE PHARMACEUTICAL DEVELOPMENT AND FEASIBILITY LAB AND THE PROJECT IS EXPECTED TO PRODUCE A FUNCTIONAL PROTOTYPE THAT MEETS ALL ESTABLISHED PROJECT PARAMETERS'}